This wiki is a place for us to document our knowledge on:

-   People Analytics POCs

-   Technical notes about commonly-used systems & data sources (e.g. BOBJ, EDP, MCP)

-   Context and details about data that spans topics and functional areas (e.g. MSEOs)

-   Context and details about topical data (e.g. demographics, pay, etc.)

-   Context and details about data usage for functional areas (e.g. training development, talent acquisition)

-   Advice/guides on analyses (e.g. retirement)

-   Analytical tools (e.g. R, Tableau)

-   People Analytics products

-   General learning resources & links

This knowledge base saves time & keeps us all on the same page.
